        <div class="bde-faq__answer-content">
            <div class="breakdance-rich-text-styles"><p>Payroll totals are recalculated from player contracts and checked automatically, roster changes are cross-checked against more than one source, and readers can report errors through the <a href="/contact/">contact form</a>.</p></div>

                    </div>
      </div>
    </div>
